message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Crisis Scenario Engine"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-27
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  The day-by-day script of a bank crisis for a simulation exercise between authorities:
  consistent numbers for a fictitious bank, what each team knows and when, the decisions due,
  and a console to run the exercise live. Single bank, cross-border group and system-wide
  exercises. A prototype from a university project (ESCP Business School, MiM).
